From: =?UTF-8?q?=C3=98yvind=20Harboe?= <oyvind.harboe@zylin.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ram: generate_ram's help lists its options
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

generate_ram takes the register-file options and passes them to
generate_ram_netlist, but its help listed none of them, so `help
generate_ram` did not show what the command takes. The README's
synopsis lacked -periphery, -wrapper_verilog and -tracks.

Commit 23 of 23 in OpenROAD #11723, carried here from it. Not
upstreamed; retires at a //:bump onto an OpenROAD that has it.
---
 src/ram/README.md   |  3 +++
 src/ram/src/ram.tcl | 15 +++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 18 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/ram/README.md b/src/ram/README.md
index 75ac7f6379..d187fd9e07 100644
--- a/src/ram/README.md
+++ b/src/ram/README.md
@@ -69,6 +69,9 @@ generate_ram [-mask_size bits]
              [-tapcell name]
              [-max_tap_dist value]
              [-write_behavioral_verilog filename]
+             [-periphery placed|verilog]
+             [-wrapper_verilog file]
+             [-tracks file]
 ```
 
 #### Options
diff --git a/src/ram/src/ram.tcl b/src/ram/src/ram.tcl
index 6532bbe572..d0a2ecf9bc 100644
--- a/src/ram/src/ram.tcl
+++ b/src/ram/src/ram.tcl
@@ -326,6 +326,21 @@ sta::define_cmd_args "generate_ram" {[-mask_size bits]
                                      [-storage_cell name]
                                      [-tristate_cell name]
                                      [-read_style tristate|and_or]
+                                     [-zero_word word]
+                                     [-reset_value value]
+                                     [-banks count]
+                                     [-bank_columns count]
+                                     [-bank_order contiguous|interleaved]
+                                     [-rb_ports count]
+                                     [-register_read_address 0|1]
+                                     [-write_style clock_gate|mux]
+                                     [-write_priority last|or]
+                                     [-cells {role master ...}]
+                                     [-name name]
+                                     [-decoder row|word]
+                                     [-bit_folds count]
+                                     [-service_columns {every sites}]
+                                     [-bank_column_layout interleaved|contiguous]
                                      [-inv_cell name]
                                      [-power_net_name name]
                                      [-ground_net_name name]
